  "title": "Asperge du Pauvre",
  "description": "&#34;Asperge du Pauvre&#34; is French for &#34;Poor Man&#39;s Asparagus&#34;, a tasty leek dish with capers and Dijon mustard vinaigrette which goes well with any meat.",
  "authors": [
    "Brian Genest"
